{% block content %}
<section class="quiz-hero shortcut-hero">
<div class="quiz-hero-text">
<p class="eyebrow">Athanas Inspires Tools</p>
<h1>Computer Shortcut Keys Trainer</h1>
<p>Practice shortcut keys the Athanas Inspires way: simple, practical, encouraging, and beginner-friendly. Learn slowly, improve daily, and move from confusion to clarity.</p>
<div class="quiz-hero-actions">
<a class="btn" href="#shortcutTrainer">Start Training</a>
<a class="btn secondary-btn" href="index.html">Back to Tools</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<main class="shortcut-page" id="main-content">
<section aria-label="Athanas Inspires Computer Shortcut Keys Trainer" class="shortcut-app-card">
<div class="quiz-topbar">
<div>
<p class="calc-mini-title">Keyboard Practice Zone</p>
<h2>Train Shortcut Keys</h2>
</div>
<div class="shortcut-stats-pill" id="shortcutBestPill">Best: 0%</div>
</div>
<div aria-label="Shortcut categories" class="shortcut-category-tabs" id="shortcutCategoryTabs">
<button class="category-tab active" data-category="All" type="button">All Shortcuts</button>
<button class="category-tab" data-category="Common" type="button">Common</button>
<button class="category-tab" data-category="Windows" type="button">Windows</button>
<button class="category-tab" data-category="Microsoft Word" type="button">Word</button>
<button class="category-tab" data-category="Microsoft Excel" type="button">Excel</button>
<button class="category-tab" data-category="Browser" type="button">Browser</button>
</div>
<div class="quiz-status-grid shortcut-status-grid">
<div class="quiz-status-card">
<span>Round</span>
<strong id="shortcutCounter">1 / 1</strong>
</div>
<div class="quiz-status-card">
<span>Score</span>
<strong id="shortcutScore">0</strong>
</div>
<div class="quiz-status-card">
<span>Streak</span>
<strong id="shortcutStreak">0 🔥</strong>
</div>
<div class="quiz-status-card">
<span>Category</span>
<strong id="shortcutCategoryName">All Shortcuts</strong>
</div>
</div>
<div class="athanas-tool-note">
<strong>Coach Athanas:</strong> Shortcuts are not for showing off — they are for saving time, working confidently, and helping your fingers become smarter than your fears.
        </div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="quiz-progress">
<div class="quiz-progress-bar" id="shortcutProgressBar"></div>
</div>
<article class="shortcut-question-card">
<div class="question-tag" id="shortcutTag">Shortcut</div>
<p class="shortcut-prompt-label">Which shortcut is used to:</p>
<h3 id="shortcutQuestion">Loading shortcut...</h3>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="shortcut-keyboard-preview" id="keyboardPreview">
<span class="keycap">Ctrl</span>
<span class="key-plus">+</span>
<span class="keycap">?</span>
</div>
<div class="answer-grid shortcut-answer-grid" id="shortcutAnswerGrid"></div>
<div aria-live="polite" class="feedback-box" id="shortcutFeedback"></div>
</article>
<div class="quiz-actions">
<button class="btn outline-btn quiz-control" id="restartShortcuts" type="button">Restart Training</button>
<button class="btn quiz-control" id="nextShortcut" type="button">Next Shortcut</button>
</div>
</section>
<aside class="shortcut-side-panel">
<div class="side-card quiz-result-card" id="shortcutResultCard">
<h3>Your Training Result</h3>
<p id="shortcutResultSummary">Answer the shortcut questions and your result will appear here.</p>
<div class="result-score-circle shortcut-score-circle" id="shortcutResultCircle">0%</div>
<button class="small-btn outline-btn share-score-btn" id="shareShortcutScore" type="button">Share My Score</button>
<a class="small-btn" href="ict-quiz.html">Play ICT Quiz</a>
<a class="small-btn submit-btn" href="../courses.html">Watch ICT Lessons</a>
</div>
<div class="side-card learning-card athanas-identity-card">
<h3>Athanas Inspires Style</h3>
<ul>
<li>Simple language for beginners.</li>
<li>Practice first, fear later — actually, fear can sit outside. 😄</li>
<li>Every mistake gives a lesson.</li>
<li>From confusion to clarity, one shortcut at a time.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="side-card learning-card">
<h3>Shortcut Memory Tips</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Ctrl + C</strong> means Copy.</li>
<li><strong>Ctrl + V</strong> means Paste.</li>
<li><strong>Ctrl + S</strong> means Save.</li>
<li><strong>Ctrl + Z</strong> means Undo.</li>
<li>Practice slowly first, then build speed.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="side-card shortcut-mini-list">
<h3>Quick Starter Set</h3>
<div><span>Copy</span><strong>Ctrl + C</strong></div>
<div><span>Paste</span><strong>Ctrl + V</strong></div>
<div><span>Save</span><strong>Ctrl + S</strong></div>
<div><span>Print</span><strong>Ctrl + P</strong></div>
<div><span>Find</span><strong>Ctrl + F</strong></div>
</div>
</aside>
</main>
